Z||000005||theogre||09-08-2001||02:00 PM||||Sounds like a rod bearing alright. I wouldn't drive it like that. the motor should be salvagable but it will likely need a crank rods and pistons. Might be less expensive to check out crate motors than have that one rebuilt. Crate usually comes with warrantee as well.<P>the cavaleir block and everything should work without any problem. Might have to fart around with the intake but that's not a huge problem. ||||reg||1
